WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.140 --> 00:00:02.500
I came to get a general
business grounding and

00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:04.800
the core curriculum does
an excellent job of that.

00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:09.100
But what's fantastic about our curriculum
is we can choose more than half of it

00:00:09.100 --> 00:00:12.390
to really focus on what's
important to us as individuals.

00:00:12.390 --> 00:00:14.870
And that's a really special
thing about the MSx Program.

00:00:14.870 --> 00:00:16.700
I've loved the academic experience, yeah.

00:00:16.700 --> 00:00:20.020
So it's obvious we're coming to business
school, we're going to be in class for

00:00:20.020 --> 00:00:21.270
most of our time during the day.

00:00:21.270 --> 00:00:26.010
And I really just like the caliber and
the thought that goes into our curriculum.

00:00:26.010 --> 00:00:28.720
And one of the reasons I came to
the GSB was really to broaden my

00:00:28.720 --> 00:00:29.990
business knowledge.

00:00:29.990 --> 00:00:32.880
And I feel that GSB has
really surpassed that for me.

